. Please indicate your interest level during the online registration process. CARPOOLS: The BBHL cannot guarantee carpool requests will be granted in the fall/winter session. There is more flexibility with carpool requests in the spring session. BBHL DIRECTOR: Questions and concerns may be directed to mmanko@sylvaniatamoshanter.com.\nRink: Tam-O-Shanter Ice Rink – Sylvania\, OH\n~58 mi from Ann Arbor\nPrice: $10\nSource: DaySmart\nInfo: https://apps.daysmartrecreation.com/dash/x/#/online/tamoshanter/event-registration\nConfirm with rink — schedule subject to change.
